                <mxCell id="limitation" value="Critical current limitation&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px;font-weight:normal&quot;&gt;The mock data has no attribution key between Shopify orders and Meta campaigns. Current CAC and ROAS are therefore blended daily metrics, not campaign-attributed metrics.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#FBBF24;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
