                <mxCell id="layer_note" value="Modeling principle&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px;font-weight:normal&quot;&gt;Source/raw -&gt; staging -&gt; optional intermediate models -&gt; marts. Fact and dimension models are modeling patterns inside the business layer, not a mandatory extra layer that must always sit before a mart. For this case, fct_marketing_performance can live directly under marts/marketing.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#FBBF24;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
